# Magic startup for pll_macro_top on IHP SG13G2.
# The vendored ihp-sg13g2-signoff.tech has a broken `lef` section (it maps
# routing/cut layers to m1..m7/via1.. names it never defines as magic types),
# which makes cifinput error out and kills both `gds read` and `lef read` --
# so Magic.SpiceExtraction produced an empty .subckt and Magic DRC silently
# did nothing.  The main ihp-sg13g2.tech is the complete tech: it includes
# cifin/cifout, the vendor drc deck, a correct lef section, and the ngspice
# device-extract rules, so one tech covers streamout, DRC and extraction.
set techdir $env(PDK_ROOT)/ihp-sg13g2/libs.tech/magic
tech load $techdir/ihp-sg13g2.tech
tech unlock *
